<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB says interest rates unchanged after meeting.</title>
<headline>SNB says interest rates unchanged after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) left its interest rates unchanged after the central bank's weekly policy-setting meeting, an SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>No change was expected by the markets.</p>
<p>The discount rate was last changed when it was cut to 1.00 percent from 1.50 percent on September 26. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
